  "rules": [
    "Source snapshot and profile identities are based on exact materialized content; provider provenance remains separate.",
    "One pinned correctness-path parser and restricted evaluator are frozen before implementation; source Lua is never executed.",
    "Raw known unknown unsupported duplicate and conflicting observations are preserved and remain linked to normalized facts.",
    "Corrections are exact digest-bound reviewed data; raw source remains unchanged and mismatch expires rather than auto-updating.",
    "Coverage conflict truncation correction and runtime-gap records gate negative authority; empty lookup is not absence by itself.",
    "The reference domain schema operation and validation bundles are static repository-owned and executed only through wow-store.",
    "ReferenceStore is immutable and read-only; no raw SQL or in-place published mutation exists.",
    "ReferenceView exposes exact typed results only and has no fuzzy semantic external or cross-profile fallback.",
